  "implementation": [
    "Allocate ordinary BOs through pageable VM descriptors with no task or permanent kernel mapping; prepare wires their pages; explicit contiguous allocations retain their existing path",
    "Remove the boot-time BO pool and its board setting; map the VM-owned descriptor into the client and release mappings without redirecting the reusable VM descriptor",
    "Use exclusive SMMU mapping for system-owned BOs, binary IOVA overlap lookup, and growing range metadata; preserve imported-memory alias checks",
    "Invalidate removed pages individually through 512 pages and invalidate the ASID for larger unmaps",
    "Retain TLB translations on ordinary submission; invalidate once after 50 ms without fence progress while retaining job references",
    "Audit the first 16 submissions and sample CPU/DRAM coherence every 64 submissions",
    "Return a refusing Metal render encoder when backend or attachment creation fails"
  ],
